ported; execution_status: trial_completed; outcome_status: unsuccessful_in_sample) - history, not a standing rule.]\\n## Trial observation\\nPriya reviewed the six reported trial attempts below. Each row records the participant's observed result after one reload; the review did not establish a common underlying cause.\\n\\n| Task | Playback after one reload |\\n| --- | --- |\\n| A05-P101 | Started |\\n| A05-P102 | Still stuck |\\n| A05-P103 | Still stuck |\\n| A05-P104 | Started |\\n| A05-P105 | Still stuck |\\n| A05-P106 | Still stuck |\\n\\n## TL conclusion\\nTwo of six attempts restored playback; four did not. The trial did not provide a dependable general workaround. The batch-05 authorization remains time-limited and is not extended into a later queue.\\n\\nContinue recording task IDs and reproduction details. Do not describe the incident as fixed or assume that a new batch has the same cause.\", \"retrieved_as\": {\"role\": \"RELATED_RECORD\", \"detail\": \"recorded backward link from audio-playback-trial-approval; series link from audio-playback-trial-approval\", \"links\": [{\"link\": \"backward\", \"from\": \"audio-playback-trial-approval\"}, {\"link\": \"series\", \"from\": \"audio-playback-trial-approval\"}]}}], \"retrieval_notes\": {\"withheld_by_version\": [], \"version_diagnostics\": []}, \"rubric\": {\"version\": \"severity-rubric-v3-semantic-signals\", \"scope\": \"SHARED_DEFAULT\", \"levels\": {\"HIGH\": {\"definition\": \"Issue creating or reasonably indicating a serious risk to data integrity, labeling quality, operational continuity, or required safety procedures. May affect many tasks, cause difficult-to-reverse errors, or require prompt escalation. Serious impact may be inferred from the described behavior even when it is not explicitly stated.\", \"examples\": \"Widespread incorrect labeling caused by conflicting instructions; required QN/safety controls being bypassed; major LT outage; systemic QA misalignment affecting a batch; Operational r